{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"27":"Chapters on Slaughtering"},"section_detail":{"27":{"hadithnumber_first":3162,"hadithnumber_last":3199,"arabicnumber_first":3162,"arabicnumber_last":3199,"name_native":"فصول في الذبح"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3175,"arabicnumber":3175,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا ابو الاحوص، عن عاصم، عن الشعبي، عن محمد بن صيفي، قال ذبحت ارنبين بمروة فاتيت بهما النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم فامرني باكلهما","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":27,"hadith":14}}]}